  "published": "2026-11-13T19:09:02.283Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v0.7.0: C# 15 union outcomes, net11.0 only: WebhookOutcome with IBillingWebhookProcessor and ClaimOutcome with IExternalPurchaseClaims, plus their case records. Older targets are unchanged and no existing interface gained a member.\n\nv0.6.1: Adds the net11.0 target. No API or behaviour change.\n\nv0.6.0: Adds the optional IBillingRefundFulfillment. BREAKING: ITelegramBot.AnswerPreCheckoutAsync takes payload, amount and currency.\n\nv0.5.3: ITelegramBot gains CreateInvoiceLinkAsync (Bot API createInvoiceLink). BREAKING for external ITelegramBot implementers on netstandard2.0/net472: no default interface members there, the method must be implemented (return Task.FromResult<string?>(null) to keep the old behaviour).\n\nv0.5.0: First standalone release. Split out of TechTeaStudio.Billing so implementing the host seams no longer requires the ASP.NET Core shared framework. Targets netstandard2.0 and net472 alongside net5.0 through net10.0, so a .NET Framework 4.6.2+ assembly can share these contracts with a modern billing host. Namespaces are unchanged (TechTeaStudio.Billing.Abstractions, TechTeaStudio.Billing), so existing code needs no edits. Note that on netstandard2.0/net472 the two default-implemented members of IBillingPaymentStore must be implemented, because those runtimes have no default interface members.\n\nFull changelog: https://github.com/TechTeaStudio/Billing/blob/product/CHANGELOG.md",
